<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 16.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain</p>
<p>trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Southampton, Tewesbury,</p>
<p>Avonmouth and Gloucester Apr 114.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Apr 100.25 May</p>
<p>101.00/01.50/02.00 Jun 104.00/03.75 Jul 106.50/06.00 Sep 101.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire May 102.50/02.00 Jun 104.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr 100.00 Jul 107.50</p>
<p>West Norfolk Oct/Dec 103.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 100.00</p>
<p>No feed barley business was reported</p>
</text>
